{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And Yoseif was in Egypt.</b> But he and his sons were included in the seventy! What does this come to teach us? Did we not know that he was in Egypt? Rather, to inform you of Yoseif's righteousness — he is the same Yoseif who tended his father's flocks, he is the same Yoseif who was in Egypt and became king, yet he stood in his righteousness (Shemot Rabbah)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:04.869643048Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}